---
const boxes = [
	{ x: 0, title: 'Your code', lines: ['SendAsync'] },
	{ x: 150, title: 'Retry handler', lines: ['sends again', 'after Retry-After'] },
	{ x: 300, title: 'Limit handler', lines: ['1. estimate cost', '2. wait for units', '5. record response'], wide: true },
	{ x: 490, title: 'API', lines: ['hidden quota', '429 + Retry-After'] },
];
---

<figure class="diagram not-content">
	<svg viewBox="0 0 610 250" role="img" aria-labelledby="flow-title flow-desc">
		<title id="flow-title">The path of a request</title>
		<desc id="flow-desc">
			Your code calls the retry handler. The retry handler calls the limit handler. The limit handler estimates the cost, waits in the token bucket and sends the request to the API. The response goes back through the classifier and the controller, which set the new rate of the bucket.
		</desc>
		<defs>
			<marker id="flow-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto">
				<path d="M0 0L10 5L0 10z" class="ink" />
			</marker>
		</defs>
		{
			boxes.map((b) => (
				<g>
					<rect x={b.x} y="10" width={b.wide ? 160 : 120} height="96" rx="8" class={b.title === 'Limit handler' ? 'box accent' : 'box'} />
					<text x={b.x + 10} y="34" class="head">
						{b.title}
					</text>
					{b.lines.map((l, i) => (
						<text x={b.x + 10} y={56 + i * 17} class="small">
							{l}
						</text>
					))}
				</g>
			))
		}
		<line x1="122" y1="58" x2="148" y2="58" class="link" marker-end="url(#flow-arrow)" />
		<line x1="272" y1="58" x2="298" y2="58" class="link" marker-end="url(#flow-arrow)" />
		<line x1="462" y1="58" x2="488" y2="58" class="link" marker-end="url(#flow-arrow)" />
		<text x="464" y="50" class="tiny">3. send</text>

		<rect x="300" y="150" width="160" height="40" rx="8" class="box" />
		<text x="310" y="168" class="head">Token bucket</text>
		<text x="310" y="183" class="small">rate x Burst, FIFO queue</text>
		<line x1="380" y1="108" x2="380" y2="148" class="link" marker-end="url(#flow-arrow)" />
		<line x1="392" y1="148" x2="392" y2="108" class="link" marker-end="url(#flow-arrow)" />

		<path d="M550 108 V215 H540" class="link" marker-end="url(#flow-arrow)" />
		<text x="555" y="160" class="tiny">4. response</text>
		<rect x="420" y="200" width="118" height="40" rx="8" class="box" />
		<text x="430" y="218" class="head">Classifier</text>
		<text x="430" y="233" class="small">throttle or not?</text>
		<line x1="418" y1="220" x2="292" y2="220" class="link" marker-end="url(#flow-arrow)" />
		<rect x="150" y="200" width="140" height="40" rx="8" class="box" />
		<text x="160" y="218" class="head">Rate controller</text>
		<text x="160" y="233" class="small">new rate or no change</text>
		<path d="M220 198 V170 H298" class="link" marker-end="url(#flow-arrow)" />
		<text x="226" y="164" class="tiny">set rate, pause</text>
	</svg>
	<figcaption>The limit handler sits inside the retry handler, so each attempt waits for its units.</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
	.diagram {
		margin: 1.5rem 0;
	}
	svg {
		width: 100%;
		height: auto;
		display: block;
	}
	.box {
		fill: var(--sl-color-bg-nav);
		stroke: var(--sl-color-gray-5);
	}
	.accent {
		stroke: var(--sl-color-accent);
		stroke-width: 2;
	}
	.head {
		font: 600 13px var(--sl-font);
		fill: var(--sl-color-white);
	}
	.small {
		font: 11px var(--sl-font);
		fill: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
	}
	.tiny {
		font: 10px var(--sl-font);
		fill: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
	}
	.link {
		fill: none;
		stroke: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
		stroke-width: 1.5;
	}
	.ink {
		fill: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
	}
	figcaption {
		font-size: var(--sl-text-sm);
		color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
		margin-top: 0.5rem;
	}
</style>
